{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Movement｜结构图\n当前类和权威边界；步态/转身时序见 [[GGYGO_流程_移动与位移.canvas|流程图]]，曲线读取见 [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|子图]]。[[Movement/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent\n`Input_Move(Value)` → 连续轴值进入 CMC。\n跑步请求经 `RequestRunOnNextMove()`；[[Input/结构]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMovementSet\n`GetSpeedForGait(Gait)` → 固定速度兜底。\n`bUseCurveDrivenSpeed` / `RootMotionScale` / `MaxCurveDrivenSpeed` → 当前曲线规则；转身阈值也在这里。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\n`TickComponent()` → Super 前采曲线。\n`UpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement()` → 步态/转身/刹停。\n`GetMaxSpeed()` → 曲线或步态速度。\n`PhysicsRotation()` → 转身 YawDelta。\n`SetMovementSet()` → 注入配置。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 305,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sampler",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimCurveSampler\n`Sample(AnimInstance, dt, OutMotion)` → 读 Speed、位置、路程、方向和 Yaw。\n`ResetBaseline()` → 避免切段/失去 Mesh 后跳变。\n[[Animation/曲线处理]]",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "rms",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FRootMotionSource_GGYGOCurve\n`PrepareRootMotion()` → Speed/Direction 按入口 BaseYaw 转世界速度，交 CMC RootMotion。\n`NetSerialize()` → 复制基准角、缩放和结束策略。",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FSavedMove_GGYGO\n`SetMoveFor()` → 保存步态、转身与 CurveMotion。\n`PrepMoveFor()` → 重演前恢复。\n`CanCombineWith()` → 阻止不兼容 move 合并。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateFrame\nCMC 发布输入、步态与曲线转身语义；AnimBP 只读选择表现。[[Animation/结构]]",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "input",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "cmc",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "提交移动输入"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "set",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "cmc",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "提供移动规则"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "sampler",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "cmc",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "当前曲线采样值"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "cmc",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "rms",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "应用曲线动作位移"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "cmc",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "saved",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "保存影响预测的自定义状态"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "cmc",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "frame",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "发布只读语义"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "rms",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "saved",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "位移状态参与预测"
    }
  ]
}
